  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cash Consortium for Sudan (CCS) - FY2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">On behalf of the Cash Consortium of Sudan (CCS), Mercy Corps requested &#xa3;21,275,000 to enable the continuation of life-saving humanitarian assistance through an effective, efficient, and people-centred response to the complex emergency in Sudan. The proposed response aims to reach 143,340 individuals across the most affected states in Sudan. Targeted locations include the most conflict-affected areas as well as displacement hotspots, with a particular focus on areas classified as IPC Phase 4 and 5. Part A budget (original) - &#xa3;13,500,000Part A budget (revised October 2025) - &#xa3;18,500,000Part B budget - &#xa3;2,775,000</narrative>
  </description>
